WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Start with a kernl. Compose runtime, permissions, services, and your shell.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Connect your host with createShellBridge(adapter).

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Register a theme service. App requests pass through capability checks.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.000
A real Paja runtime connects the sandboxed app and returns its host theme.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
Your runtime. Your rules. Build with kernl.
